  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Thank you... Thank you so much..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "It's not safe here. You should hurry and leave."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Leave...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Where... would we go?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "This was a place we could call home... But it's all ruined now..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I'm sorry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's not your fault..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Infected",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "It's not..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "I didn't expect Reunion, the self-proclaimed savior of the Infected, to attack other Infected."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Now that... is what I call bad publicity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "This Reunion infiltration did not just occur spontaneously."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "I'm sure there were many Infected here who chose to follow Reunion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "Ugh... They'd rather trust Reunion over Rhodes Island--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Rhodes Island does not give empty promises."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "There are many Infected who are willing to accept whatever Reunion offers, even if it's nothing more than an illusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "There are few who can see through the illusion."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "And among those who can, most are willing to give up everything just for that vague glimmer of hope."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Who would choose to believe our little bunny, who is too kind to deceive others?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I believe her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Misha...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Nnh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Be careful! You can't move around yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I'm just a bit dizzy... Don't worry."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Is Reunion... still chasing us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I don't know what they want from me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Let's go..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "Amiya."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "I understand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Let's leave right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Shortly, we'll be able to exit the slums and meet up with the L.G.D."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "Thank you, Misha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "No..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misha",
      "speakerId": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "I... should be thanking you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
